## Context
Child of 1074 (census and blind-spot pass there). `isolation: "worktree"` is a
Claude Code Agent parameter inside skills that must run on Pi and Codex too.
Lightening: remove it, and the prohibitions that exist only to dodge it.

## Scope
- hunt, raid, gaze (REROLL fix agent), team-lead, merge/roar wording: the
  executor creates its own worktree with `git worktree add
  .claude/worktrees/<name> -b <branch>`, runs `git worktree lock` on it, and
  works only there; remove `isolation: "worktree"` and gaze's reviewer
  prohibitions about it.
- Keep the session `EnterWorktree` opt-in untouched (ticket 1077).
- Update the tests pinning the old text (test_hunt_worktree_ownership,
  test_hunt_triage_prestep, test_verify_fork_contracts) to pin the new recipe.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] No `isolation: "worktree"` left in skills/ or agents/
- [ ] Recipe includes `git worktree lock`; worktree-gc honours it
- [ ] `make check` passes
